This repository is NOT open source, and no licence is granted by its presence
here. Nothing in it may be copied, modified, distributed, sublicensed or used to
build a competing product without the copyright holder's prior written
permission. Access to the source does not carry a licence to it.

This repository is the service mesh and the web front door. It is a different
repository from the desktop IDE, which is a fork of an editor distributed under
its own upstream licence; that upstream licence and its third-party notices
govern that code and travel with those builds (`nexora-ide/LICENSE.txt`,
`nexora-ide/ThirdPartyNotices.txt`).

## Why this file exists

The workspace had no licence file at all, which is not a neutral state: under
default copyright, "no licence" means "all rights reserved", but the absence of a
written notice leaves every reader — a customer's counsel doing diligence, a
contributor, an investor — to guess. This file makes the default explicit rather
than implied. The decision and its reasoning are recorded in
`company/DECISIONS.md`.

Third-party components used by this repository are the property of their
respective authors and are governed by their own licences; a machine-readable
inventory is maintained in `branchcraft/platform/package-lock.json` and
`branchcraft/nexora-svelte/package-lock.json`.

## Contributions

Contributions are accepted only under the terms described in
`CONTRIBUTING.md`. Please do not send a contribution you are not able to license
to the copyright holder.
